WEBVTT

00:16.870 --> 00:18.000
Found you!

00:22.590 --> 00:23.710
Mika-chan!

00:25.050 --> 00:26.420
Fumi-chan!

00:34.180 --> 00:36.060
Fumi-chan, found you!

00:36.560 --> 00:39.020
You're very tomboyish, Mika.

00:39.980 --> 00:41.690
Yeah, it's okay.

00:41.690 --> 00:43.770
You're very feminine to make up for me, Fumi-chan.

00:44.110 --> 00:46.610
The two of us are one, right?

00:47.110 --> 00:47.780
Yep.

00:48.400 --> 00:50.950
The two of us are one.

00:58.500 --> 00:58.750
The true forms

01:00.330 --> 01:00.580
Of the things that I gazed at

01:02.210 --> 01:02.460
Were for showing after I closed my eyes

01:03.290 --> 01:06.170
Shigofumi

01:05.920 --> 01:06.170
Again today, time

01:07.760 --> 01:08.010
Will only construct a loneliness

01:09.550 --> 01:09.800
That seems to be torn apart, right?

01:16.970 --> 01:17.220
There are people who can't forget about

01:20.640 --> 01:20.890
The white lotuses that bloom in the darkness

01:24.270 --> 01:24.520
Nevertheless, recollections

01:28.030 --> 01:28.280
Visit from the future

01:31.700 --> 01:31.950
Words that turn into sighs

01:39.120 --> 01:39.370
Are the emerging wings of the soul

01:42.790 --> 01:43.040
Will I flutter apart?

01:46.500 --> 01:46.750
Growing confused and disordered

01:50.170 --> 01:50.420
I want to carve

01:52.510 --> 01:52.760
These letters to you

01:57.510 --> 01:57.760
Pieces of the truth

01:59.350 --> 01:59.600
Of things that I want to tell you-

02:01.230 --> 02:01.480
I can't even send them well to you

02:04.980 --> 02:05.230
If I write them with the blood that stains my fingertips

02:08.650 --> 02:08.900
Then can they spill into your heart?

02:12.320 --> 02:12.570
Even if the one word left behind

02:15.570 --> 02:15.820
To us who live

02:18.240 --> 02:18.490
Is to be goodbye

02:26.380 --> 02:28.630
Fumika, give me authorisation, quickly!

02:34.800 --> 02:35.970
Fumika?!

02:39.560 --> 02:41.270
See, it hurts, doesn't it?

02:41.270 --> 02:43.390
This is dangerous.

02:43.390 --> 02:47.060
Understand, Fumika? You mustn't points things like this at people.

02:48.860 --> 02:51.190
Fumika, are you okay?

02:51.190 --> 02:52.740
Fumika!

02:53.650 --> 02:55.570
A doctor...

02:55.570 --> 02:57.030
An ambulance!

02:57.030 --> 03:00.540
Ah! We can't call for a doctor. The hospital is no good either.

03:02.950 --> 03:04.870
Isn't she your daughter?!

03:06.330 --> 03:10.290
Stop, he's Mikawa Kirameki-sensei.

03:10.290 --> 03:11.710
S-Stop!

03:11.710 --> 03:12.880
So...

03:20.220 --> 03:21.890
You bastard!

03:27.480 --> 03:29.690
Open up! Open up now!

03:30.060 --> 03:33.480
Are you the one who's been influencing my Fumika?

03:33.480 --> 03:35.860
Tell me your name! Your full name!

03:35.860 --> 03:38.530
We're deeply sorry, Sensei.

03:38.530 --> 03:40.870
Please wait in there for a while.

03:40.870 --> 03:42.290
You've got to be joking!

03:42.290 --> 03:43.750
You're going to get it!

03:43.750 --> 03:46.250
I'll erase your future in this industry!

03:46.790 --> 03:48.040
Um...

03:48.670 --> 03:50.500
Here. The edge of your mouth.

03:52.130 --> 03:53.380
Thank you.

03:54.050 --> 03:55.210
It's all right.

03:56.170 --> 03:59.430
I wasn't expecting much to begin with.

04:00.430 --> 04:01.600
No way!

04:10.060 --> 04:12.360
See, I told you.

04:14.110 --> 04:17.860
If the doctors saw something like
this, there would be a huge uproar.

04:22.740 --> 04:23.580
Natsuka?

04:23.580 --> 04:24.790
Give me a moment!

04:27.460 --> 04:28.460
Okay.

04:29.460 --> 04:31.880
Is Mikawa all right?

04:31.880 --> 04:33.710
Yeah, sort of.

04:33.710 --> 04:37.260
She got shot, didn't she? I think
we really should call for an ambulance.

04:37.260 --> 04:39.010
Fumika won't die.

04:41.340 --> 04:42.550
The staff...

04:44.390 --> 04:45.520
spoke.

04:45.520 --> 04:47.310
It's not "staff", it's Kanaka!

04:47.310 --> 04:48.390
Kanaka!

04:48.390 --> 04:50.270
It's too troublesome.

04:50.270 --> 04:53.690
It beats having to fill out reports and
then having problems come from it, right?

04:55.940 --> 04:57.570
What the heck is that?

04:57.570 --> 04:59.650
A speaker?

04:59.650 --> 05:00.990
Of course not.

05:00.990 --> 05:03.660
The staff is talking.

05:03.660 --> 05:05.160
Right?

05:05.160 --> 05:07.700
Kanaka is alive and can talk.

05:07.700 --> 05:08.500
Yes.

05:08.500 --> 05:10.620
Does someone finally understand?

05:11.000 --> 05:12.960
You will talk, won't you?

05:12.960 --> 05:15.590
About yourself and all that.

05:25.100 --> 05:27.520
Say, about her growing up...

05:27.520 --> 05:29.180
You talking about Fumika?

05:29.180 --> 05:30.890
There's no one else, right?

05:30.890 --> 05:32.770
She's the only postal worker who ages.

05:33.060 --> 05:35.060
All postal workers are dead people.

05:35.610 --> 05:38.940
Thus, time forever stops for them as well as their growth.

05:39.400 --> 05:41.570
And they can't die any further.

05:42.240 --> 05:45.030
Which means, she's different from us.

05:45.030 --> 05:47.830
She's the only one who looks her age.

05:48.830 --> 05:51.120
So, you're saying she's still a child?

05:52.290 --> 05:54.960
She's too young to be a postal worker.

05:55.790 --> 05:57.090
Just kidding.

06:02.010 --> 06:05.470
Before, I was a human named Mikawa Fumika.

06:05.760 --> 06:06.600
As I suspected.

06:06.600 --> 06:09.470
Huh? Then who's the sleeping girl in the hospital?

06:09.470 --> 06:13.190
That's right. She's been unconscious
since three years ago, right? In spite of that...

06:13.190 --> 06:15.940
Let Fumika finish her story.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.610
We can ask questions after.

06:18.270 --> 06:19.860
Sorry.

06:19.860 --> 06:20.940
Go on, Fumika.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.910
My father is Mikawa Kirameki.

06:26.910 --> 06:29.200
The man who shot me earlier.

06:29.200 --> 06:32.910
My mother divorced him soon after I was born.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.630
Aizawa Kirei.

06:36.630 --> 06:38.290
She's was an actress, right?

06:38.710 --> 06:39.710
Yes.

06:39.710 --> 06:42.260
Just like her name, she was beautiful.

06:42.260 --> 06:46.590
I believe she remarried and is now living overseas.

06:46.590 --> 06:51.100
That's why I've never known Aizawa Kirei, my mother.

06:52.220 --> 06:56.020
My father, Mikawa Kirameki, raised me.

06:57.020 --> 06:59.110
Fumika, it's meal time.

06:59.610 --> 07:01.900
Here, I made it easy to eat.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.360
Yay!

07:05.820 --> 07:08.160
Daddy, Daddy.

07:08.570 --> 07:10.530
Here, ahh.

07:16.750 --> 07:19.670
Kirameki was a kind father.

07:19.670 --> 07:21.840
He was a person who loved himself.

07:21.840 --> 07:24.420
As one from his own flesh and blood, he loved me too.

07:26.050 --> 07:26.970
But...

07:33.430 --> 07:35.020
Daddy!

07:35.020 --> 07:37.520
Look! It's you, Daddy!

07:41.320 --> 07:43.940
Fumika, it's art time.

07:46.990 --> 07:51.330
I don't remember when and how it started.

08:28.950 --> 08:32.280
Death is like a frozen world.

08:33.700 --> 08:35.450
Nothing living.

08:35.910 --> 08:37.290
No colours either.

08:38.000 --> 08:41.630
No grass, no flowers, no seasons, nothing.

08:42.290 --> 08:43.420
However...

08:43.920 --> 08:46.760
the world of the departed is beautiful.

08:48.840 --> 08:51.470
A silent colour that takes you far away.

08:52.010 --> 08:55.010
No insects, no bacteria, no filth.

08:55.010 --> 08:59.310
Ultimately pure, untainted beauty.

08:59.890 --> 09:00.600
Kirei?

09:03.230 --> 09:04.110
Daddy?

09:04.110 --> 09:06.230
This isn't it!

09:06.230 --> 09:08.030
Kirei isn't here.

09:08.030 --> 09:09.990
It's not you!

09:11.110 --> 09:12.200
It hurts.

09:13.030 --> 09:15.830
Kirei? Kirei you say?

09:15.830 --> 09:17.240
What's so beautiful about her?!

09:17.580 --> 09:19.460
You filthy monster!

09:21.040 --> 09:24.130
Women, lies, vanity!

09:24.420 --> 09:25.750
Betrayal?

09:28.420 --> 09:31.800
That's right. You traitor!

09:32.380 --> 09:33.840
That hurts!

09:40.680 --> 09:44.310
Why did Kirameki-sensei do such a thing?

09:46.610 --> 09:47.730
Drafting.

09:48.780 --> 09:55.160
Kirameki often used my body
to draft his work and collect ideas.

09:55.700 --> 09:57.870
I really hated it.

09:57.870 --> 09:59.660
I was really scared.

09:59.660 --> 10:01.460
But, I had no choice but to endure it.

10:02.120 --> 10:05.040
Because, I didn't know any father other than Kirameki.

10:07.550 --> 10:09.260
I loved you.

10:09.800 --> 10:12.220
Just like the clarity of ice.

10:12.220 --> 10:14.300
So beautiful, it's like sin.

10:14.800 --> 10:15.970
And yet...!

10:24.810 --> 10:26.190
And yet...!

10:26.690 --> 10:29.690
I hate you. I hate you!

10:31.440 --> 10:33.110
I love you!

10:33.450 --> 10:35.240
Daddy, I love you!

10:35.570 --> 10:36.700
I hate you!

10:36.990 --> 10:42.620
I hate you! I hate you!

10:37.580 --> 10:40.160
I love you, you know.

10:40.700 --> 10:42.080
Daddy...

10:43.960 --> 10:45.540
Begone!

10:45.540 --> 10:47.290
You tainted woman!

10:47.290 --> 10:49.670
Forever! Get away from me!

10:50.170 --> 10:54.590
Disappear, fall, leave me!

10:55.430 --> 10:59.560
My gentle daddy couldn't have possibly done this.

11:03.850 --> 11:05.390
This is fantasy.

11:08.060 --> 11:09.770
This isn't me.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.900
This is me!

11:15.570 --> 11:17.160
This is wrong.

11:17.160 --> 11:21.200
Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong! Wrong!

11:21.330 --> 11:24.660
Begone!

11:33.590 --> 11:37.380
And just like that, I was born.

11:38.140 --> 11:40.140
Shigofumi

11:41.180 --> 11:43.180
Shigofumi

11:46.890 --> 11:49.440
Two personalities?

11:49.730 --> 11:52.020
But, there are two of you.

11:52.020 --> 11:54.400
Yeah, one is in the hospital.

11:54.400 --> 11:57.490
And another, a Shigofumi postal worker.

11:59.070 --> 12:02.740
I'm Mika. The personality who runs away.

12:02.740 --> 12:06.210
The unfair child who pushed
everything she hated to Fumi-chan.

12:15.840 --> 12:19.090
I'm a bad girl.

12:19.220 --> 12:22.220
That's not true, Fumi-chan is a good girl.

12:22.600 --> 12:23.810
Mika.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.930
Did you come again?

12:25.930 --> 12:26.850
Yes.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.520
Ow!

12:34.900 --> 12:36.070
Does it hurt?

12:36.360 --> 12:37.400
No.

12:37.950 --> 12:39.490
I'm fine.

12:39.490 --> 12:41.280
Thank you, Mika.

12:41.570 --> 12:45.290
Fumi-chan, once we get out of the bath, let's draw a castle.

12:45.580 --> 12:46.370
Castle?

12:46.370 --> 12:50.250
Yes, in the castle, a prince and a princess live.

12:50.250 --> 12:51.830
And there's a ball at night.

12:51.830 --> 12:53.380
Will there be a cat and a clown?

12:53.380 --> 12:56.130
There will. And Mr. Owl the teacher.

12:56.510 --> 12:59.170
He likes the anteater maid, doesn't he?

12:59.170 --> 13:02.510
But, he's such a glutton, so he always gets turned down.

13:05.510 --> 13:07.600
We were friends.

13:08.230 --> 13:10.310
My only friend in the world.

13:12.860 --> 13:16.400
The hippo soldier is a glutton.

13:16.400 --> 13:20.900
Eating and drinking everything.

13:20.900 --> 13:25.450
Even things like that. Even things like this.

13:30.330 --> 13:33.710
Thank you Mr. Hippo.

13:33.710 --> 13:36.250
Everyone, lend me your strength.

13:37.050 --> 13:41.470
Kirameki-sensei abused his own daughter, didn't he?

13:41.760 --> 13:43.840
He's lost his mind.

13:44.350 --> 13:46.140
Novelists, all of them.

13:46.140 --> 13:47.680
So what?

13:47.680 --> 13:51.440
It's because of that he's able to write books which can sell 800,000 copies.

13:51.980 --> 13:54.230
That's why you kept quiet about his problem, huh?

13:55.190 --> 13:57.860
It's amazing how I've managed to
sweep everything under the carpet, isn't it?

13:57.860 --> 14:00.940
Well, we are publishers after all.

14:11.910 --> 14:14.250
Are you really all right?

14:14.750 --> 14:17.460
Yeah, but it still hurts a little.

14:17.460 --> 14:20.380
Didn't anyone ever notice?

14:20.380 --> 14:22.550
About the abuse you... two received.

14:22.550 --> 14:26.430
We were never let out of the house.

14:27.220 --> 14:30.890
So, I'd never seen another person other than Kirameki.

14:31.810 --> 14:34.690
I never experienced kindergarten or elementary school.

14:35.600 --> 14:38.070
Middle school was my first school.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.280
Mikawa Fumika

14:42.280 --> 14:44.240
Mikawa Fumika

14:50.620 --> 14:52.370
It was the first time...

14:52.370 --> 14:54.420
I've seen so many people.

14:56.130 --> 14:58.840
And because of that, you always stayed in the infirmary?

14:58.840 --> 15:00.670
You must have been frightened.

15:01.420 --> 15:02.460
Yes.

15:02.460 --> 15:03.420
But...

15:14.140 --> 15:17.020
But, it wasn't all scary.

15:18.480 --> 15:21.530
My heart was tired from being around so many people.

15:21.530 --> 15:22.820
I was nervous.

15:23.570 --> 15:26.780
But, Fumi-chan tried hard and kept on going to school.

15:28.120 --> 15:29.990
Because she loved school.

15:29.990 --> 15:30.990
Loved?

15:30.990 --> 15:35.460
Umm, you're Mika, right?

15:35.460 --> 15:36.000
Yes.

15:36.290 --> 15:38.540
So, the one who went to school was...

15:38.540 --> 15:39.790
Fumi-chan.

15:39.790 --> 15:42.630
I watched over her from deep inside her mind.

15:44.800 --> 15:46.340
Even when she turned you down.

15:48.300 --> 15:51.220
It wasn't that Fumi-chan disliked you.

15:51.720 --> 15:53.520
She was startled, and without thinking...

15:55.270 --> 15:57.100
Isn't that good to hear, Kaname-kun?

15:57.100 --> 15:59.230
That was back in middle school!

15:59.230 --> 16:03.610
If it didn't bother you, then you wouldn't
go through so much just to find her, right?

16:03.610 --> 16:06.240
Onee-san, please do something about your sister.

16:18.370 --> 16:19.210
What was that?

16:19.210 --> 16:20.170
A gas explosion?

16:20.750 --> 16:21.960
Kirameki!

16:27.300 --> 16:28.470
Hooray!

16:30.140 --> 16:30.840
Mikawa!

16:30.840 --> 16:31.890
Fumika?!

16:32.600 --> 16:34.430
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

16:39.060 --> 16:41.230
I must punish you.

16:41.230 --> 16:42.980
Now which shall I pick?

16:42.980 --> 16:45.940
I wonder which one I should pick. I can't decide.

17:04.460 --> 17:06.000
Have you remembered?

17:09.680 --> 17:11.430
It was me who shot you.

17:11.720 --> 17:14.760
Fumika! Fumika!

17:16.010 --> 17:17.720
The key is on the other side.

17:17.720 --> 17:18.980
Mikawa!

17:18.980 --> 17:20.100
Open up!

17:21.230 --> 17:23.310
Mikawa! Mikawa!

17:23.310 --> 17:24.730
Fumika!

17:36.740 --> 17:37.830
Damn it!

17:37.830 --> 17:39.000
Fumika!

17:39.000 --> 17:40.160
Use me!

17:41.290 --> 17:42.670
Onee-chan?!

17:42.960 --> 17:44.460
Fumika!

17:49.170 --> 17:50.760
How dare you hit me?

17:50.760 --> 17:52.800
Even though I loved you so much.

17:52.800 --> 17:54.680
I hate you!

17:54.680 --> 17:56.680
Begone and disappear!

17:57.010 --> 18:01.770
Despite how you treated her,
Fumi-chan loved you till the very end.

18:02.310 --> 18:03.400
But...

18:07.730 --> 18:09.360
Daddy, I love you!

18:20.250 --> 18:22.620
Are you going to betray me too?

18:24.420 --> 18:27.380
I'm going to drive Kirei out of you!

18:30.090 --> 18:33.260
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

18:33.630 --> 18:39.600
Fumi-chan is going to die.

18:35.430 --> 18:39.310
It hurts. It hurts. Daddy.

18:39.310 --> 18:41.220
It hurts!

18:41.730 --> 18:45.400
Fumi-chan is going to die.

18:45.980 --> 18:47.360
Fumi-chan...

18:47.360 --> 18:49.480
Stop bullying Fumi-chan!

19:11.340 --> 19:14.130
Fumi-chan wasn't the one who shot you.

19:14.130 --> 19:15.130
It was me.

19:15.590 --> 19:20.220
But, Fumi-chan believed that
she shot you, and locked herself away.

19:20.760 --> 19:22.720
She could no longer hear even my voice.

19:23.390 --> 19:26.600
I should leave your final judgement to Fumi-chan...

19:27.690 --> 19:28.690
but...

19:29.690 --> 19:31.530
you shall die now!

19:33.440 --> 19:34.860
Stop it, Fumika.

19:34.860 --> 19:38.200
The Gospel Department won't stay silent if you kill a human.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.240
Like I care!

19:39.240 --> 19:39.830
Eh!

19:40.160 --> 19:42.790
For how much Fumi-chan loved you...

19:43.250 --> 19:44.710
I shall hate you for her.

19:45.210 --> 19:47.460
For what Fumi-chan didn't do, I shall.

19:47.870 --> 19:50.290
Fumi-chan, Fumi-chan...

19:53.670 --> 19:58.720
Kanaka-san, your work will be
jeopardised if it became a police case, right?

19:58.720 --> 20:00.640
No, no. No police.

20:00.640 --> 20:03.350
We won't be able to explain ourselves.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.430
Then, it's decided.

20:04.430 --> 20:05.230
Huh?

20:07.600 --> 20:12.360
We'll get him to work and help
pay for Fumika-san's hospital fees.

20:12.940 --> 20:18.820
Also, I'd like to read your work, even
though you're a useless good-for-nothing.

20:19.950 --> 20:22.700
So, you're going to write, aren't you?

20:22.700 --> 20:24.660
I can't.

20:24.660 --> 20:26.830
I can't write without Fumika.

20:26.830 --> 20:29.460
It's going to be a problem if you don't write.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.540
I tried!

20:31.540 --> 20:33.250
But, I just can't write.

20:33.250 --> 20:35.050
So, please...

20:35.050 --> 20:36.380
Don't be a child!

20:42.180 --> 20:45.270
Your sister really surprised me.

20:45.770 --> 20:48.140
She's strong when it matters most.

20:48.440 --> 20:50.850
But still, that was...

20:50.850 --> 20:53.520
Yeah, I never thought she could do something like that.

20:53.520 --> 20:55.070
Fumika too.

20:55.690 --> 20:58.070
That's the first time I've seen you like that, Fumika.

20:59.400 --> 21:01.990
From now on, let's have no secrets between us.

21:01.990 --> 21:04.450
Because, we're partners after all.

21:06.700 --> 21:07.450
Yeah.

21:07.450 --> 21:11.830
You became a postal worker to
wait for the other Fumika, didn't you?

21:12.460 --> 21:15.500
And you chose this place as your delivery zone on purpose.

21:18.260 --> 21:19.470
Yeah.

21:19.470 --> 21:22.590
Because, we promised that we shall always be together.

21:22.590 --> 21:26.010
Say, can we wait together with you?

21:27.060 --> 21:32.190
Just like how you loved her, we loved her too.

21:35.610 --> 21:37.360
I love her too!

21:37.360 --> 21:38.440
So...

21:40.740 --> 21:41.280
Okay?

21:41.780 --> 21:42.570
Yeah.

21:46.080 --> 21:47.200
Thank you.

21:47.490 --> 21:48.580
All of you.

21:51.160 --> 21:56.000
Shigofumi

21:51.160 --> 21:56.000
Episode Eight

21:51.160 --> 21:56.000
The Beginning

23:26.760 --> 23:28.390
The bright and cheerful you.

23:28.800 --> 23:30.310
The smiling you.

23:31.220 --> 23:35.600
Your truth is within the glimmer of the southern seas.

23:36.770 --> 23:38.730
Next time on Shigofumi:

23:38.730 --> 23:41.230
Shigofumi

23:38.730 --> 23:41.230
Episode Nine

23:38.730 --> 23:41.230
Reunion
